; Sony's PlayStation Multitap (SCPH-1070): a V of two arms, four controller
; sockets with a memory card slot over each, and one cord whose connector fills a
; console's controller port and the card slot above it. Built in code; see
; ps_multitap.gd. The cord leaves the inner corner of the V (the back of the
; vertex post), its -Z toward the console.
